@startuml deployment
!include _theme.puml
' One runnable local development arrangement, not a production topology.
node "Local development host" {
  node "Browser" as Browser
  node "Vite dev server\n:5173" as Vite
  node "Uvicorn / FastAPI\n:8000" as Api
  database "SQLite\napplication and queue" as Sql
  node "Python worker\nseparate process" as Worker
  node "Fake ATS · optional\nloopback :8901" as Fake
}
Browser -right-> Vite : HTTP
Vite -down-> Api : /api proxy
Api -left-> Sql : SQL
Worker -up-> Sql : leases
Worker -right-> Fake : test browser
@enduml
